text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn for each Swamp you control.', 'Black creatures get +1/+1.', 'Choose one —\\n• Untap all lands you control.\\n• Until end of turn, lands you control become 2/2 creatures that are still lands.\\nEntwine {2}{G} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Do this before you draw.)', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{B}: Regenerate Wall of Bone. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{T}: Add {G}.", 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Discard a card: Wild Mongrel gets +1/+1 and becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Echo {1}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Albino Troll.', "Enchant Forest\\n{2}: Enchanted Forest becomes a 4/4 green Spirit creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted Forest is put into a graveyard, you may return Genju of the Cedars from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Enchant Swamp\\n{2}: Until end of turn, enchanted Swamp becomes a 2/2 black Spirit creature with "{B}: This creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn." It\'s still a land.\\nWhen enchanted Swamp is put into a graveyard, you may return Genju of the Fens from your graveyard to your hand.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature is a Treefolk with base power and toughness 0/4 and loses all abilities.', 'Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, enchanted creature deals 1 damage to its owner.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{B}: Vampire Bats gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than twice each turn.", 'Flying\\nDiscard Faerie Macabre: Exile up to two target cards from graveyards.', 'Flying\\nWhen Howling Banshee enters the battlefield, each player loses 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Keening Banshee enters the battlefield, target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Skeletal Vampire enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 black Bat creature tokens with flying.\\n{3}{B}{B}, Sacrifice a Bat: Create two 1/1 black Bat creature tokens with flying.\\nSacrifice a Bat: Regenerate Skeletal Vampire.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "If you control a Forest, rather than pay this spell's mana cost, you may have an opponent gain 3 life.\\nTarget creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.", "If you control a Swamp, you may pay 4 life rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nDestroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Polluted Mire enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Sacrifice a Beast: You gain 4 life.', 'Search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Serrated Arrows enters the battlefield with three arrowhead counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no arrowhead counters on Serrated Arrows, sacrifice it.\\n{T}, Remove an arrowhead counter from Serrated Arrows: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nFading 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three fade counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a fade counter from it. If you can't, sacrifice it.)", 'Slippery Karst enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nMadness {3}{B} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Tendrils of Corruption deals X damage to target creature and you gain X life, where X is the number of Swamps you control.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return a green creature you control to its owner's hand.", "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Vicious Hunger deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Indrik Stomphowler enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'Whenever a Beast enters the battlefield, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may gain 1 life.', 'Windstorm deals X damage to each creature with flying.', '[+1]: Target player discards a card.\\n[−2]: Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top.\\n[−8]: Put all creature cards from all graveyards onto the battlefield under your control.', '[+1]: Untap two target lands.\\n[−1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\\n[−4]: Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', '{1}{G}: Basking Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.\\nMadness {0} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', '{2}{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Each other player loses 2 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', '{4}{B}, {T}: Target player discards two cards. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nChannel — {5}{B}{B}, Discard Ghost-Lit Stalker: Target player discards four cards. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)']
flavor: ['"A little dark magic won\'t stop me. The worse the curse, the better the prize."\\n—Radavi, Joraga relic hunter, last words', '"All we know about the Krosan Forest we have learned from those few who made it out alive."\\n—Elvish refugee', '"Death is no excuse for disobedience."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Graveyards are sacrilege! A waste of perfectly good bones."\\n—Keren-Dur, necromancer lord', '"I have become a gourmet of sorts. Each soul has its own distinctive flavor. The art is in inviting the right company to the feast."', '"She is truly Wirewood\'s child now."\\n—Elvish refugee', '"The bigger they are, the faster they rot."', '"The bones of allies grant wisdom. The bones of enemies grant strength. The bones of dragons grant life eternal."', '"The dead make good soldiers. They can\'t disobey orders, never surrender, and don\'t stop fighting when a random body part falls off."\\n—*Nevinyrral, Necromancer\'s Handbook*', '"We don\'t like interlopers and thieves cluttering our skies."\\n—Dionus, elvish archdruid', '"Words lie. People lie. The land tells the truth."', '"You know I accept only one currency here, and yet you have sought me out. Why now do you hesitate?"\\n—Xathrid demon', "An indrik's howl has destructive power much subtler than that of its crushing foot.", "Beneath the Tangle, the wurm tunnels stretch . . . wide as a stone's throw, long as forever, deep as you dare.", 'Bulgo paused, puzzled. What was that rustling sound, and why did he feel so stiff? And how could his *feet* be so thirsty?', "Darkness doesn't always send its minions to do its dirty work.", 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'Hatred outlives the hateful.', 'Her cold wail echoes in the alleys and under-eaves, finding the unfortunate and turning their blood to ice.', 'It takes no prisoners, but it keeps the choicest bits for Phyrexia.', 'It teaches *you* to play dead.', 'Liliana developed a fondness for the moment when roaring becomes squealing.', "Nature doesn't walk.", 'Nature twists knots stronger than any rope.', "Nature's secrets can be read on every tree, every branch, every leaf.", "Nature's strength outlives the strong.", 'Nothing is sacred to rats. Everything is simply another meal.', 'Only the most ravenous soul feeds on the health of the weak.', 'The line between dream and death is gauzy and fragile. She leads those too near it from one side to the other.', 'The most violent and destructive storms in Femeref occur on cloudless days.', 'There are things beneath the murk for whom the bog is a stew, a thin broth in need of meat.', 'Villagers cloaked the town in magical silence, but their ears still bled.']
artist: ['Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Ciruelo', 'Daarken', 'Dan Frazier', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Allsop', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Gary Leach', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Ittoku', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kev Walker', 'Mark Tedin', 'Massimilano Frezzato', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Paul Lee', 'Pete Venters', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robert Bliss', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Stephen Daniele', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Tsutomu Kawade', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
