'UST', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['+1: Target player discards a card.\\n-2: Search your library for a card, then shuffle your library and put that card on top of it.\\n-8: Put all creature cards in all graveyards onto the battlefield under your control.', '+1: Untap two target lands.\\n-1: Put a 3/3 green Beast creature token onto the battlefield.\\n-4: Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn for each Swamp you control.', 'B', 'Black creatures get +1/+1.', 'Choose one — Untap all lands you control; or until end of turn, lands you control become 2/2 creatures that are still lands.\\nEntwine {2}{G} (Choose both if you pay the entwine cost.)', 'Corrupt deals damage equal to the number of Swamps you control to target creature or player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Defender\\n{B}: Regenerate Wall of Bone.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Discard a card: Wild Mongrel gets +1/+1 and becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Echo {1}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Albino Troll.', "Enchant Forest\\n{2}: Enchanted Forest becomes a 4/4 green Spirit creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted Forest is put into a graveyard, you may return Genju of the Cedars from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Enchant Swamp\\n{2}: Until end of turn, enchanted Swamp becomes a 2/2 black Spirit creature with "{B}: This creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn." It\'s still a land.\\nWhen enchanted Swamp is put into a graveyard, you may return Genju of the Fens from your graveyard to your hand.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nWhen enchanted creature is put into a graveyard, put a 3/3 green Elephant creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature is a 0/4 Treefolk with no abilities.', 'Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, enchanted creature deals 1 damage to its owner.', 'Flying\\nDiscard Faerie Macabre: Exile up to two target cards from graveyards.', 'Flying\\nWhen Howling Banshee enters the battlefield, each player loses 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Keening Banshee enters the battlefield, target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Skeletal Vampire enters the battlefield, put two 1/1 black Bat creature tokens onto the battlefield.\\n{3}{B}{B}, Sacrifice a Bat: Put two 1/1 black Bat creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield.\\nSacrifice a Bat: Regenerate Skeletal Vampire.', 'Flying\\n{B}: Vampire Bats gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate this ability no more than twice each turn.', 'G', "If you control a Forest, rather than pay Invigorate's mana cost, you may have an opponent gain 3 life.\\nTarget creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.", "If you control a Swamp, you may pay 4 life rather than pay Snuff Out's mana cost.\\nDestroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Plated Slagwurm can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.", 'Polluted Mire enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Put a 4/4 green Beast creature token onto the battlefield.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Put target creature card in a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Sacrifice a Beast: You gain 4 life.', 'Search your library for a Forest card and put that card onto the battlefield. Then shuffle your library.', 'Serrated Arrows enters the battlefield with three arrowhead counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no arrowhead counters on Serrated Arrows, sacrifice it.\\n{T}, Remove an arrowhead counter from Serrated Arrows: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nFading 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three fade counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a fade counter from it. If you can't, sacrifice it.)", 'Slippery Karst enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nMadness {3}{B} (If you discard this card, you may cast it for its madness cost instead of putting it into your graveyard.)', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Tendrils of Corruption deals X damage to target creature and you gain X life, where X is the number of Swamps you control.', "Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return a green creature you control to its owner's hand.", "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Vicious Hunger deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Indrik Stomphowler enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'Whenever a Beast enters the battlefield, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever another creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may gain 1 life.', 'Windstorm deals X damage to each creature with flying.', '{1}{G}: Basking Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate this ability only once each turn.\\nMadness {0} (If you discard this card, you may cast it for its madness cost instead of putting it into your graveyard.)', '{2}{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Each other player loses 2 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', '{4}{B}, {T}: Target player discards two cards. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.\\nChannel — {5}{B}{B}, Discard Ghost-Lit Stalker: Target player discards four cards. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.', '{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)']
original_type: ['Artifact', 'Basic Land — Forest', 'Basic Land — Swamp', 'Creature — Antelope Beast', 'Creature — Bat', 'Creature — Beast', 'Creature — Boar Beast', 'Creature — Elf', 'Creature — Faerie Rogue', 'Creature — Horror', 'Creature — Hound', 'Creature — Human Shaman', 'Creature — Human Spellshaper', 'Creature — Lizard', 'Creature — Plant Wall', 'Creature — Rat', 'Creature — Skeleton', 'Creature — Skeleton Wall', 'Creature — Spirit', 'Creature — Troll', 'Creature — Vampire Skeleton', 'Creature — Wurm', 'Creature — Zombie Mutant', 'Creature — Zombie Warrior', 'Enchantment', 'Enchantment — Aura', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Planeswalker — Garruk', 'Planeswalker — Liliana', 'Sorcery', 'Tribal Enchantment — Treefolk Aura']
